  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-source-control",
      "text": "DSH 插件：在 DSH Web GUI 内置右侧 Sidebar 中以「源代码管理」页显示**当前会话工作区**的仓库、提交图、变更列表与提交框。界面控件取自 DSH 内置组件，因此外观与 Harness 本身一致。仓库自动绑定当前会话工作区，无需手动选择。\n\n[English](README.en.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **提交图**：泳道图显示提交与引用标记，分页自动加载，悬停出卡片，点击就地展开改动文件，右键完成检出、分支与标签操作。\n- **变更与提交**：工作区变更分组列出并可暂存 / 丢弃，提交框支持 Enter 提交与修补上一次提交，提交信息可由 AI 生成。\n- **差异页**：并排 / 统一视图、自动换行、按 hunk 显示。\n- **GitHub 集成**：通过 `gh` CLI 新建仓库并推送，以及创建 Pull Request；未安装 / 未登录 / 缺权限时降级。\n- **远程协议**：远程地址可在 HTTPS 与 SSH 之间双向切换，切换前检测本地 SSH 状态。\n- **文本日志**：按 Android logcat threadtime 格式记录，每次启动一个文件，按日归档，保留 15 天、单日上限 15 MB；单份写满 60000 字符时另起一份。\n- **反馈**：设置面板的「反馈」页签或存储库区标题行的反馈按钮填写并提交 issue；可勾选附带日志，日志文本按评论上限合并成若干条评论追加在该 issue 下。\n- **安全**：破坏性操作先确认，操作失败以弹窗说明原因，动作结果以轻量提示告知。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "每一项功能的完整说明见[功能说明](Docs/功能/功能说明.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "打开入口",
      "text": "两个入口都来自本插件，打开同一个页：\n\n| 入口 | 行为 |\n|---|---|\n| 引导页入口胶囊 | 右侧栏 tab 条「+」打开引导页后，点「源代码管理」胶囊 |\n| 会话 header 图标按钮 | 直接打开该页；已打开时聚焦 |\n\n切到别的侧栏页或工作区再回来时，页面保持原状（不会重新加载，展开状态也不丢失）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-source-control"
    },
    {
      "section": "重启 dsh web，页面右侧栏「+」→ 引导页出现「源代码管理」，会话 header 亦有图标按钮",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install\npnpm run verify-all  # 文档门禁\npnpm lint            # 静态检查\npnpm test            # 构建、重复代码门禁与单元测试\n\n代码结构与构建约定见[代码结构](Docs/实现/代码结构.md)与[构建与测试](Docs/实现/构建与测试.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "本项目自身代码为 MIT，见 [LICENSE](LICENSE)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-source-control",
      "text": "A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/DeepSeek-ai/deepseek-harness) (dsh) plugin that adds a **Source Control page** to the DSH Web GUI's built-in right Sidebar: the commit graph, the working-tree changes list, and a commit box. Its controls come from DSH's own components, so it looks and behaves like the rest of the Harness. The repository is bound automatically to the current session's workspace; no manual repo selection is needed.\n\n[中文文档](README.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **Commit graph**: a lane graph of commits and ref markers, with automatic paging, hover cards, in-place changed-file expansion, and right-click checkout, branch, and tag actions.\n- **Changes and commits**: the working-tree change list is grouped and can be staged or discarded, and the commit box supports Enter to commit, amending the last commit, and AI-generated messages.\n- **Diff page**: side-by-side or unified views, word wrap, and git-hunk-only rendering.\n- **GitHub integration**: create and push a repository, and create pull requests, through the `gh` CLI, degrading gracefully when it is missing, logged out, or short of scopes.\n- **Remote protocols**: a remote address can be switched between HTTPS and SSH in both directions, checking the local SSH status before switching to SSH.\n- **Text logs**: Android logcat threadtime format, one file per startup, grouped by day, kept 15 days with a 15 MB daily cap.\n- **Feedback**: submit an issue from the settings **Feedback** tab or the feedback button in the repositories header; opt in to attach logs and the tool packs a zip, creates the issue, and the user drags the zip into its comment box.\n- **Safety**: destructive actions ask for c"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "The complete description of every feature is in [功能说明](Docs/功能/功能说明.md) (Chinese only)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Entry points",
      "text": "Both entries come from this plugin and open the same page:\n\n| Entry | Behaviour |\n|---|---|\n| Guide entry capsule | Open the right Sidebar's `+` control, then pick the **Source Control** capsule |\n| Session header icon | Opens the page, or focuses the open one |\n\nSwitching to another sidebar page or workspace and coming back leaves the page as it was — it neither reloads nor loses its expanded state."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-source-control"
    },
    {
      "section": "restart `dsh web`; the right Sidebar's `+` → guide page shows Source Control, and the session header gains an icon",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install\npnpm run verify-all  # documentation gates\npnpm lint            # static checks\npnpm test            # build, duplication gate, and unit tests\n\nCode structure and build conventions are in [代码结构](Docs/实现/代码结构.md) and [构建与测试](Docs/实现/构建与测试.md) (Chinese only)."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "This project's own code is MIT. See [LICENSE](LICENSE)."
    }
  ],
